Marondera Packaging Ltd has issued 186,000 ordinary shares of US\$1 each. Its equity at 1 January 2025 was: share premium US\$24,000, revaluation reserve US\$17,500, general reserve US\$33,000 and retained earnings US\$61,400. During 2025:

- profit for the year was US\$46,850;
- land was revalued upwards by US\$8,400;
- a dividend of US\$21,600 was paid;
- a bonus issue of 1 new share for every 6 held was made, paid up from the whole of the share premium and the balance from the general reserve.
